# Reddit Outreach — configuration
# Copy to .env and fill in, or export these in your shell.

# ── Zernio (recommended: real Reddit data + publish, NO Reddit API key) ──
# Connects your Reddit account via Zernio's OAuth. Powers live discovery
# (/reddit/search) and publishing (/posts). Get a key at
# https://zernio.com -> Settings -> API Keys
# ZERNIO_API_KEY=sk_your_key_here

# ── Reddit read backend ──
# auto (default) picks: opencli > rdt > zernio > mock
# Options: opencli | rdt | zernio | mock
# REDDIT_BACKEND=auto
# Optional proxy for restricted networks (Reddit blocks many datacenter IPs)
# REDDIT_PROXY=http://user:pass@ip:port

# ── LLM for qualification / research / drafting ──
# Without a key the pipeline still runs using deterministic heuristics.
# auto (default) picks whichever key is present.
# OUTREACH_LLM_PROVIDER=auto
# OUTREACH_LLM_MODEL=

# One of the following unlocks LLM-quality output:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ── Storage ──
# Default is a local SQLite file under ./data. To use Supabase/Postgres
# instead (recommended for 24/7 + multiple workers), set DATABASE_URL to your
# Supabase connection string (Supabase dashboard -> Settings -> Database ->
# Connection string -> URI). Then: pip install "psycopg[binary]"
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres.<ref>:<password>@aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:5432/postgres
# OUTREACH_DATA_DIR=data

# ── Dashboard (the `web` process) ──
# Read-only ops UI at http://localhost:8000. Set a long random secret to unlock
# it (unset = the dashboard locks itself and shows a setup notice). Open once
# with ?token=... and a cookie remembers you.
#   python -c "import secrets;print(secrets.token_urlsafe(24))"
# DASHBOARD_TOKEN=your_long_random_secret

# ── Phase 4: Markeye handoff webhook ──
# When a Reddit lead is ready, the `handoff` command POSTs a signed payload to
# Markeye (which runs the WhatsApp SDR). Blank = dry-run preview only. You can
# also set these per-campaign (handoff_webhook_url / handoff_secret).
# MARKEYE_WEBHOOK_URL=https://your-markeye-instance/webhooks/reddit-handoff
# MARKEYE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your_shared_hmac_secret
